have pointed this out on the 2020world list, but the traffic-to-clue
ratio there is just Too High.

A fine example of forecasting that has been quite good is Bucky Fuller's
work, especially to things he forecasted in the 20's and 30's that were
realized in the 50's to 70's.  He had a very good grasp on the difference
